  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil and cook the bigoli pasta according to the package instructions until al dente.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat and saute the minced garlic until fragrant.",
    "Add the grated horseradish to the skillet and cook for 1-2 minutes until slightly softened.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lemon juice, olive oil, and dijon mustard to make the yellow glaze.",
    "Add the chicken broth to the skillet and bring to a simmer.",
    "Add the cooked bigoli pasta to the skillet, tossing to combine with the horseradish and garlic mixture.",
    "Pour the yellow glaze over the pasta and toss to combine.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the bigoli pasta hot, topped with shaved grana padano cheese."
  ],
